   "reason": "[\"Held APP transcription of EO 8413 (jobs/app-executive-orders/output/texts/executive-order-8413-exemption-hubert-k-bishop-from-compulsory-retirement-for-age.txt) differs materially from the GPO printing (jobs/photius-gpo-volumes/output/texts/EO_8413.txt, HathiTrust hvd.hl272k PDF pp. 63-64): in the operative sentence the APP text reads 'for a period of one year ending June 30, 1041.' (char offsets about 628-684 of the held text) while the printing reads 'for a period of one year ending June 30, 1941 .'; APP also reads 'title 5, see. 715a' where the printing reads 'sec. 715a'. The carried claim quotes the APP misprint '1041' (read as 1941), so its quoted span does not match the official printing and the working text cannot be confirmed. The claim needs rebuilding on the official printing's reading (June 30, 1941) with a fresh quotation span; identity (No. 8413, May 18, 1940, FRANKLIN D ROOSEVELT) otherwise agrees.\"]"
